;: t2.lca (3042PC84-70), hand-written
Version 2
Design 3042PC84 9 0
Speed -70
Editblk AA
Base FG
Config X:F Y: F:A:B:C:D G: DX: DY: ENCLK: RSTDIR: CLK: 
Equate F = ((A*~B)+(C@D))
Endblk
Editblk P11
Base IO
Config IN:I OUT: TRI: 
Endblk
Editblk P10
Base IO
Config IN:I OUT: TRI: 
Endblk
Editblk P9
Base IO
Config IN:I OUT: TRI: 
Endblk
Editblk P8
Base IO
Config IN:I OUT: TRI: 
Endblk
Editblk P7
Base IO
Config IN: OUT:O TRI: 
Endblk
Nameblk AA FUNC
Nameblk P11 IN_A
Nameblk P10 IN_B
Nameblk P9 IN_C
Nameblk P8 IN_D
Nameblk P7 OUT_F
Addnet NA P11.I AA.A
Addnet NB P10.I AA.B
Addnet NC P9.I AA.C
Addnet ND P8.I AA.D
Addnet NF AA.X P7.O
